--[[
    Obsidian UI Library -- "bananahook" skeet fork
    -----------------------------------------------
    A drop-in fork of Obsidian by deivid (github.com/deividcomsono/Obsidian),
    API modeled after LinoriaLib, reskinned to a gamesense / "juju" style menu:
      - pure black window, 100px sidebar, 12px lowercase rows, 4px corners
      - section headers drawn ON the border line (accent tick + text + rule)
      - checkbox-left toggles, inline slider bars, compact dropdown boxes
      - "hotkeys" pill HUD on the left edge with glowing bind rows
      - notification pills stacked bottom-center with a colored glow
      - two-tone brand: "banana" in white + "hook" in banana yellow
      - built entirely with Roblox instances -- no Drawing API anywhere

    Upstream scripts keep working: same CreateWindow / AddTab / AddGroupbox /
    AddToggle / AddSlider / AddDropdown / AddKeyPicker / Toggles / Options API.

    MIT licensed, same as upstream.
]]

